.function main 0 16
LOAD_CONST R1 1
LOAD_CONST R2 2
ARRAY_NEW R0 R1 2
POSSIBILITY_BUILD R0 R3
INFO_SAMPLE R3 R4
PRINT R4
LOAD_CONST R5 42
ARRAY_NEW R6 R5 1
POSSIBILITY_BUILD R6 R7
RESOLVE R7 R8
PRINT R8
LOAD_CONST R9 7
EVIDENCE R9 R10 source
DERIVATION R10 R11
PRINT R11
EXPLAIN R10 R12
PRINT R12
ASSUME R9 R13 assumption
DERIVATION R13 R14
PRINT R14
RETURN R0
